---
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Layout demo" noIndex>
	<header slot="header" class="border-rule border-b">
		<div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-4">
			<p class="font-display text-kicker tracking-kicker text-ink-3 uppercase">header slot</p>
			<p class="text-caption text-ink-3">named slot demo</p>
		</div>
	</header>

	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
		<p class="font-display text-kicker tracking-kicker text-ink-3 uppercase">demo</p>
		<h1 class="font-display text-h1 tracking-display mt-2">Base layout</h1>
		<p class="text-body text-ink-2 mt-4 max-w-prose">
			Manual verification surface for <code>~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro</code>. The page below should
			render on the warm paper background with body copy set in Noto Sans and the display heading
			above in Space Grotesk. Press <kbd>Tab</kbd> from the address bar to reveal the skip link in the
			top-left, then press <kbd>Enter</kbd> to jump focus to the main region.
		</p>

		<h2 class="font-display text-h2 tracking-display mt-12">Checks</h2>
		<ul class="text-body text-ink-2 mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
			<li>Background: <span class="text-small font-mono">bg-paper</span> (warm cream).</li>
			<li>
				Body font: <span class="text-small font-mono">Noto Sans</span> — this paragraph should render
				in it.
			</li>
			<li>
				Display font: <span class="text-small font-mono">Space Grotesk</span> — both headings should render
				in it.
			</li>
			<li>Skip link: hidden by default, becomes visible on focus.</li>
			<li>
				<code>noIndex</code> is set, so the page should emit
				<span class="text-small font-mono">{`<meta name="robots" content="noindex">`}</span>.
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 class="font-display text-h2 tracking-display mt-12">Long-content guard</h2>
		<p class="text-body text-ink-2 mt-4 max-w-prose">
			Padding the page so the footer slot lands below the fold and the skip-link landing target (<code
				>#main</code
			>) actually moves the viewport when activated.
		</p>
		<div class="bg-paper-2 mt-8 h-[60vh] rounded" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	</section>

	<footer slot="footer" class="border-rule mt-16 border-t">
		<div class="text-caption text-ink-3 mx-auto max-w-5xl p-6">
			Footer slot · independent named slot
		</div>
	</footer>
</BaseLayout>
